      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ANGRY CHIEF (1) flew the lids off the inside draw with a fast early split and gave a sight, finishing a half a length second (24.08) over 425m at Bendigo. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. One of the contenders. URGING (2) produced a moderate performance last time when fifth at Warrnambool over 390m behind Blackpool Finn (22.58) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Must be included in calculations. PAW BALLISTA (5) hit the ground running with a slick early sectional but ran over late and missed the frame when a 2 length fourth (23.26) over 400m at Geelong. Form from his last run is proving strong. Better than last start and can bounce back. CHOW MEIN (6) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
